# steps/table-receiver.md §10: a field of a part's root is a unit field for the part's methods, and the
# program's methods are visible from them -- the field peek of the part unit_s7_part_root_collide_refused_part.lm2
# (harness Parts) and the source's method peek are one name there: "method collides with a unit field" at the
# field, in the part, as for a field of the source.
fn: peek () size_t
return: 1U
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
